      "ar": "**PREP structure**: **P**oint (رأيك في جملة)، **R**eason (ليه)، **E**xample (مثال أو رقم)، **P**oint (رأيك تاني). بسيط ومناسب للاجتماعات والرسايل. «I recommend a queue. Our bursts are 40× normal traffic. Last campaign we lost 60 orders. So a queue is the safest option.»",
      "en": "The **PREP structure**: **P**oint (your view in one sentence), **R**eason (why), **E**xample (an example or a number), **P**oint (your view again). Simple and good for meetings and messages. «I recommend a queue. Our bursts are 40× normal traffic. Last campaign we lost 60 orders. So a queue is the safest option.»"
